t evening, he climbed the tower and lit the beacon with renewed purpose, knowing now that his family's legacy of guiding lost souls had deeper roots than he ever imagined.", "w02": "凌晨四点的城市沉浸在深蓝色的寂静中。高楼大厦如同沉睡的巨人，窗户里偶尔闪烁的灯光像是梦呓。街道空荡荡的，只有清洁工的扫帚沙沙声和远处的救护车鸣笛打破宁静。天空中星星依稀可见，月亮西斜。便利店的霓虹灯在黑暗中闪烁，几个夜班工人在里面整理货物。这是属于城市的梦境时刻，介于昨天的尾声和明天的序曲之间，短暂而神秘。", "w03": "• A function is like a recipe that tells the computer what to do with ingredients you give it, and it can use the same recipe over and over again.\n• Sometimes a recipe might need you to follow another recipe inside it—like baking a cake that needs frosting, and frosting is made using a separate recipe.\n• A function can even call itself to solve smaller versions of the same problem, like finding your way out of a maze by solving smaller mazes inside it."}
